  "content": "\n\n<p>此材质包在旋转物品（特别是武器）时，增加了与 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpunchy-fpa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">punchy!</a> 模组的兼容性。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>注意：如果您希望我添加更多模组的兼容性，请加入该模组的 Discord 服务器，在“创作/附加组件/模组剑”板块发送消息；如果发现任何漏洞，也请在此反馈。</strong></p>\n<p>正在寻找 Forge 模组？</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmodded-swords-x-punchy!-v2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组剑 x punchy! v2</a></p>\n<h3>兼容的模组 1.20.1 - 1.21.1</h3>\n<p><strong>（RPG 系列）</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">弓箭手 (RPG 系列)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpaladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">圣骑士与牧师 (RPG 系列)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">法师 (RPG 系列)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">盗贼与战士 (RPG 系列)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fberserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">狂战士 RPG 职业</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252floot-n-explore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">拾取与探索</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flne-rogues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LNE 盗贼</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flne-wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LNE 法师 附加组件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fberserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">狂战士 RPG 职业</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farsenal-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">军械库 (RPG 系列)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flne-paladins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LNE 圣骑士</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252felemental-wizards-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">元素法师 RPG</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwitcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">猎魔人 RPG 职业</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeath-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">死亡骑士</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fforcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">力量大师 RPG 职业</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">雇佣兵与工匠</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>农夫乐事</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffarmers-delight-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事 Refabricated</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fends-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末地乐事</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnethers-delight-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下界乐事 Refabricated</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetterenddelight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Betterenddelight</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>简单剑</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsimplymore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多简单剑</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsimply-swords\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简单剑</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmythicmetals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神话金属 + 简单剑（兼容）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fepic-knights-shields-armor-and-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗骑士</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstick-n-stone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">棍石</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>小型 Boss / 首领 / 怪物</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faquamirae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">水镜</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">大规模毁灭 Boss</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmutant-monsters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">变异怪物</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmyths-of-the-sea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">海洋神话</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fillager-invasion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">灾厄入侵</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fearth-and-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">大地与水</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenderman-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末影人重做</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcompanions-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">伙伴！</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fknight-quest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">骑士任务</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>新维度</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetterend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的末地</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fthe-twilight-forest-unofficial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色森林非官方版</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjadens-nether-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jadens 下界扩展</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更深幽暗</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fminecells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢细胞</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>游戏机制</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-weathering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸式风化</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">补充内容</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftrowel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">抹刀</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>新版本现已兼容 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更佳战斗 (Better Combat)</a>，推荐使用该模组以获得更佳的游戏体验。</p>",
